tc qdisc del dev eth0 root
tc qdisc del dev eth0 ingress
tc qdisc del dev eth1 root
tc qdisc del dev eth1 ingress
tc qdisc del dev ifb0 root
tc qdisc del dev ifb1 root
modprobe ifb numifbs=2
ip link set dev ifb0 up
ip link set dev ifb1 up
set -ex
tc qdisc add dev ifb0 root handle 1: cake bandwidth 100mbit diffserv4 # download0
tc qdisc add dev ifb1 root handle 2: cake bandwidth 200mbit diffserv4 # download1
tc qdisc add dev eth0 root handle 3: cake bandwidth 10mbit diffserv4 # upload0
tc qdisc add dev eth1 root handle 4: cake bandwidth 20mbit diffserv4 # upload1
tc qdisc add dev eth0 handle ffff: ingress # ingress0
tc qdisc add dev eth1 handle ffff: ingress # ingress1
tc filter add dev eth0 parent ffff: matchall action mirred egress redirect dev ifb0 # redirect0
tc filter add dev eth1 parent ffff: matchall action mirred egress redirect dev ifb1 # redirect1
